A||||9||GT Bastard||Don't look!!!!  You just might miss it...  ||||3||
Z||000000||GT Bastard||12-13-2000||01:26 AM||||Sometimes when I'm in the midst of work(or other senseless bullshit) I begin to picture myself smack-dab in the middle of the most beautiful landscape imaginable, and I ask myself why I'm not there right now.  Earthly concerns are petty in this paradise.  In fact, they don't exist.  Nobody exists.  I don't need to occupy myself with hobbies and social activities.  I no longer wonder or care what others may think or do.  I exist only to absorb the beauty that surrounds me.  And then reality kicks in, and I wonder what just happened.  Somebody approaches me and begins uttering nonsense about what needs to be done next.  Force of habit takes over, and I begin going about my daily tasks again without thinking.||||reg||3
Z||000001||stimpy||12-13-2000||01:52 AM||||Just the other day, I was tending to my unicorn flock and enjoying a breakfast of milk and honey, just enjoying the lovely purple sky and cotton candy scented breeze, when I had a sudden vision of sitting at a desk with a phone headset on, actually having to work for a living to pay something that I understand is called "bills". Very disturbing. I hope that doesn't happen again. <P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||DaRkLoRD||12-13-2000||02:09 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by stimpy:<BR><B>enjoying a breakfast of milk and honey,</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hmm.. I'll stick to my usual orange juice and fresh muffin... or toasted bagel and medium coffee (nescafe french vanilla, double cream double sugar... mmmm...) if I'm late for class and need to wake up.<BR>The only time I like honey is when it's on a sandwich with peanut butter and bananas.. hehe... haven't had that since I was a little kid though.<P>yes, I'm aware my post was completely off-topic.....  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||12
